  step,dige:2b840e0ba238da72
  step=2,dige:5cf226ad429f5f2a
    Assertion:a-body-row-is,sentence:a body row is keyed by its own body key not the soul — one soul wears many bodies so the durable per-body key is what a roster row IS
    Assertion:the-body-key-is,sentence:the body key is durable and one per soul per store — ensure honours the cache and a second soul in the same store mints a key of its own
    Assertion:which-row-is-me,sentence:which row is me is computed from the body key never a stored flag — the mint writes no self bit onto the row so nothing false can replicate
  step=3,dige:94cc6f565e892219
    Assertion:the-self-answer-is,sentence:the self answer is body-local — a friend absorbing the roster computes its own body as self and no self flag ever crossed the wire
  step=4,dige:8fa3136b9456981b
    Assertion:the-vessel-subnet-picks,sentence:the vessel subnet picks the bare address first then ascends the suffixes — an individual local subnet has a deterministic primary and an empty one picks nothing
  step=5,dige:183ddc5be0f8646a
    Assertion:a-reminted-body-wears,sentence:a reminted body wears its caveat — minting a key while the division already stands keyed stamps remint onto the fresh row and keeps the old seat standing while a virgin soul mints clean — a fork is seen never silently absorbed
  step=6,dige:b2403edcdb69ba25
    Assertion:a-frame-that-could,sentence:a frame that could not go stands as a debt on the counterparty row — deduped by kind so retries cannot grow it — a paid debt detaches and an empty shelf removes itself — the cap folds overflow into a dropped count that outlives full payment
  step=7,dige:d06d42c33c1bacbd
    Assertion:the-family-derives-from,sentence:the family derives from the standing grants at any time — a captain reads its cave off its own live signature and a linkee reads its own role and kept name off the husk — the soul never appears as a phantom member and a foreign signature confers nothing
  step=8,dige:f6a12557eeb68103
    Assertion:the-heal-converges-the,sentence:the heal converges the roster on the standing grants and the seat attests it — a granted member keeps its seat while unbacked junk retires and the founding-gap captain survives — a living grant retires the fork caveat and the pre-key ghost drops — the signed charter lists exactly the standing division and a settled family heals to no change
    Assertion:the-founder-signs-its,sentence:the founder signs its own captaincy — a divided seat holding no husk grant mints a MyCaptain onto its self-husk pier at the heal so every post including the captain derives from a standing grant and the founder-inference decays to a fallback
  step=9,dige:2ed4cac620b17c41
    Assertion:the-family-grants-replicate,sentence:the family grants replicate between siblings — each soul-signed atom self-verifies so a sibling derives the captaincy it never witnessed — a retargeted atom refuses at the signature and an unsigned relic stays home
  step=10,dige:48df69270f22512a
    Assertion:a-reach-is-one,sentence:a reach is one durable addressed intent — it books and stands as legible matter routed off the family charter — an offline dispatch leaves the intent standing rather than minting a separate debt — and the target hears it serves it through its own doer marks it arrived and it graduates away
  step=11,dige:e8f9744c2bd71fbb
    Assertion:the-reach-settle-loop,sentence:the reach settle loop observes until its knob is flipped — then the booker hears the outcome and closes the trip — an arrived reach graduates away while a refused one stands as a visible receipt
  step=12,dige:436a0587f154cdeb
    Assertion:the-reach-wire-lane,sentence:the reach wire lane is gated on the roster — a rostered sibling books work on me while a stranger lands nothing — and the outcome reports back to the seat the roster names for the booker
  step=13,dige:67ac27de1531a8d3
    Assertion:the-crew-read,sentence:the crew read projects the standing reaches into one legible glance — tallied by state with each intent carrying what it is and who it is for — so what the whole crew is doing reads at once instead of hiding across the ghosts
  step=14,dige:eef6d4c7a3eea0e7
    Assertion:a-body-describes-the,sentence:a body describes the organ it grows — a pocket of what it wants now and a trove of everything as quantities on its own row — re-describing updates in place and each organ reads back by its kind
  step=15,dige:7c45bc36ad980a51
    Assertion:a-body-ships-its,sentence:a body ships its own organ sizes and a sibling lands them onto the roster row they describe — so the phone sees the laptop trove — while an organ for a body it does not roster lands nothing
  step=16,dige:1b55082c77532ef7
    Assertion:the-reach-shelf-is,sentence:the reach shelf is bounded — a new booking beyond the cap is refused so a runaway loop cannot flood it — while re-booking a reach that already stands is always honoured so a retry is never lost
  step=17,dige:a2554963bc6778d4
    Assertion:a-refused-receipt-ages,sentence:a refused receipt ages out — the settle loop sweeps one older than its window so dead receipts cannot fill the cap — while a fresh refusal still stands for its moment to be seen
